err.http_connect:
HTTP API connection failed: {url}
  {error}
Check: 1) uhttpd / HTTPS is enabled
      2) this machine can open {base}

err.ssh_auth:
Authentication failed: wrong password or key
  Host: {host}:{port}
  User: {user}
Fix: run openwrt setup or set the correct password

err.ssh_timeout:
Connection timed out ({timeout}s): {host}:{port}
  Cause: router offline / firewall / SSH is not on port {port}
Check: 1) router is rebooting
        2) confirm the SSH port in the web UI
        3) LAN IP may have changed (check DHCP)

err.ssh_connect:
Cannot connect to {host}:{port}
  Error: {error}
Check: SSH listening on port {port} (Dropbear default 22)

err.ssh_banner:
Cannot read SSH protocol banner: {host}:{port}
  Cause: peer closed before handshake, or this port is not SSH
Check: 1) port forward points at Dropbear (default 22)
        2) SSH connection limit; retry later
        3) try locally: ssh -p {port} {user}@{host}
